1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
The 72-hour rule:

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Follow up within 3 days
of meeting someone. Or accept you probably never will.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Day 1: they remember you clearly.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Day 3: still warm.
No reintroduction needed.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
Week 2+: you're a stranger
with shared trivia.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
The message can be five words. “Good meeting you at [place].”

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Timing beats wording.
Every time.

8
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Try the 7-day plan. Link in bio.
